1
00:00:00,634 --> 00:00:02,634
(Sheldon:)Thank you.
But you said

2
00:00:02,636 --> 00:00:04,866
you might introduce me to him...
I'm free on Thursday.

3
00:00:06,439 --> 00:00:08,009
(Bernadette:)Hey, hey,
they're leaving.

4
00:00:08,008 --> 00:00:10,838
(Penny:)What? Here,
give me, give me.

5
00:00:10,844 --> 00:00:13,444
(Penny:)Oh, my God. Oh, my God,
they're coming right towards us.

6
00:00:13,447 --> 00:00:16,517
(Bernadette:)We got to get out of here.
Okay. Well, wait, what about Leonard?

7
00:00:16,517 --> 00:00:19,547
(Bernadette:)He and his tiny bladder
can take the bus!

8
00:00:19,553 --> 00:00:21,383
(starts engine)

9
00:00:22,255 --> 00:00:23,755
(both gasp)

10
00:00:23,757 --> 00:00:24,957
Oh, no!

11
00:00:24,959 --> 00:00:26,429
(turns off engine)

12
00:00:29,395 --> 00:00:31,735
She just hit my car!

13
00:00:31,732 --> 00:00:33,802
(Amy:)What are you guys
doing here?

14
00:00:33,801 --> 00:00:37,771
Oh! Hey, Ames!
What are you doing here?

15
00:00:38,671 --> 00:00:40,001
LEONARD:
What happened?

16
00:00:40,840 --> 00:00:42,070
OMG!

17
00:00:42,076 --> 00:00:44,006
(Penny:)Aren't you
Leonard Hofstadter?

18
00:00:44,011 --> 00:00:45,511
(Sheldon:)Yeah.

19
00:00:45,512 --> 00:00:48,242
(Dave:)I saw you speak at Stanford
with Sheldon Cooper!

20
00:00:48,248 --> 00:00:50,918
(Dave:)Amy, can you believe it?
It's Dr. Leonard Hofstadter!

21
00:00:52,919 --> 00:00:55,089
(Amy:)No. Pinch me.

22
00:00:55,089 --> 00:00:57,819
(Dave:)It's an absolute pleasure to meet you.
Can I shake your hand?

23
00:00:57,825 --> 00:00:59,825
(Leonard:)I don't know if you want
to do that... I was just...

